 order made by the competent authority under sub-section (II) of section 20(D) of the said act shall be final. -- 37 of 68 -- 38 THE GAZETTE OF INDIA : EXTRAORDINARY [PART II—SEC. 3(i)] The land plans and other details of the land covered under this notification are available and can be inspected by the interested person at the aforesaid office of the competent authority. SCHEDULE Brief Description of Land to be acquired, with or Without Structures, falling within the proposed Special Railway Project Jambusar - Kavi Gauge Conversion Project (Western Railway) in the District of Bharuch in the State of Gujarat. State: Gujarat District: Bharuch Si.No. Name of Taluka Name of Village Surve No./ Block No. Area in Hecter 1 Jambusar Jambusar Survey No. 2740/2 0.0086 2 Survey No. 2740/3 3 Survey No. 2739 0.0855 4 Survey No. 2738 0.0360 5 Survey No. 2737 0.0597 6 Survey No. 2716/p2 0.0801 7 Survey No. 2716/2/p 8 Survey No. 2716/p1 9 Survey No. 2709 0.0698 10 Survey No. Road 0.0090 11 Survey No.2710 City Survey No.5111 0.2675 12 Survey No.2710/2 13 Survey No.2711 City Survey No.5110 0.0196 14 Road 0.0467 -- 38 of 68 -- [भाग II—खण्ड 3(i)] भारत का रािपत्र : असाधारण 39 15 Survey No.2667/1 City survey No.4457 0.1384 16 Survey No. 2667/2 17 Survey No. 2668 0.0830 18 Survey No.2668/p1 City Survey4458 19 Survey No.2666 City Survey No.4447 0.1057 20 Survey No.2660/1 City Survey No.4455 0.0758 21 Survey No. 2660/2 22 Survey No. 2656/1 0.0530 23 Survey No. 2656/2 24 Survey No. 2657 0.0927 25 Survey No.2658 City Survey No.4453 0.1608 26 Survey No. 1448 0.0398 27 Survey No. 1446 0.0107 28 Survey No. 1445 0.0106 29 Survey No.689/1 City Survey No.2669 0.0091 30 Survey No.689/2 City Survey No.2670 -- 39 of 68 -- 40 THE GAZETTE OF INDIA : EXTRAORDINARY [PART II—SEC. 3(i)] 31 Survey No. 689/3 City Survey No.2671 32 Survey No.689/4 City Survey No.2672 33 Survey No.690/1 City Survey No.2668 0.0310 34 Survey No. 690/2 35 Survey No. 690/3 36 Survey No. 690/4 37 Survey No. 690/5 38 Survey No.700 Ci